// Silice's own songs and sound effects -> the extracted Emerald song that plays for each until
// the author's tracks land (Milestone 12; `games/silice/music/*.mid`, see
// docs/plans/2026-10-24-milestone-12-audio.md). Keys: the `MUS_SIL_*` of `ids/songs.ron` and the
// invented `SE_*` names the scripts use; values: Gen3 `MUS_*` / `SE_*` names. The content build
// fails on a key it cannot place or a value that is not an Emerald song.
(
    songs: {
        "MUS_SIL_ALERTE_BRECHE": "MUS_ENCOUNTER_MAGMA",
        "MUS_SIL_APEX_BRUME": "MUS_SEALED_CHAMBER",
